# Personal correspondence and job-application material — this repo is public.
linkedin-*.txt
*-recruiter-*.txt

# Pasted terminal transcripts used while debugging a run. The logs under
# results/logs/ are the durable record; these are scratch.
#
# Matched anywhere in the name rather than anchored at the start: an earlier
# pattern of ps-output*.txt missed new-ps-output.txt, which was then committed.
*ps-output*.txt
*terminal-output*.txt
*-running-output.txt
